msgid "文件事件通知"
msgstr "File Event Notification"

msgid ""
"inotify 是 Linux 文件事件接口，不属于 POSIX。应用通过 libc 的 ``<sys/inotify.h>`` 调用；内核的 ``<linux/inotify.h>`` 由 "
"``headers_install`` 导出，不需要修改 BusyBox 或 musl。"
msgstr ""
"inotify is a Linux file event interface, not part of POSIX. Applications call it through libc's "
"``<sys/inotify.h>``; the kernel's ``<linux/inotify.h>`` is exported by ``headers_install``, "
"without requiring BusyBox or musl changes."

msgid "接口与使用"
msgstr "Interface and Usage"

msgid ""
"x86-64 syscall 编号与 Linux 一致：``inotify_init`` 为 253， ``inotify_add_watch`` 为 "
"254，``inotify_rm_watch`` 为 255， ``inotify_init1`` 为 294。常见事件循环先以 ``IN_NONBLOCK | IN_CLOEXEC`` "
"创建实例，为目录安装监听，再读取初始列表， 通过 ``poll`` 或 ``epoll`` 等待并读取通知。监听前发生的变化没有历史重放。"
msgstr ""
"x86-64 syscall numbers match Linux: 253 for ``inotify_init``, 254 for ``inotify_add_watch``, 255 "
"for ``inotify_rm_watch``, and 294 for ``inotify_init1``. A typical event loop creates an instance "
"with ``IN_NONBLOCK | IN_CLOEXEC``, installs directory watches, reads the initial listing, then "
"waits with ``poll`` or ``epoll`` and reads notifications. Changes before watch installation are "
"not replayed."

msgid ""
"``read`` 返回完整的 ``struct inotify_event`` 记录；固定头为 16 字节， 可选名称包含 NUL 和对齐填充。容量小于下一条记录时返回 ``EINVAL``， "
"不拆分记录；非阻塞空队列返回 ``EAGAIN``。阻塞等待可被信号中断。 ``readv`` 同样以每个 iovec 的容量容纳完整记录，不把一条记录拆到两个 "
"iovec；``FIONREAD`` 返回队列内包含填充的总字节数。"
msgstr ""
"``read`` returns complete ``struct inotify_event`` records. The fixed header is 16 bytes; an "
"optional name includes NUL and alignment padding. A buffer smaller than the next record returns "
"``EINVAL`` without splitting the record; an empty nonblocking queue returns ``EAGAIN``. Signals "
"can interrupt blocking waits. ``readv`` likewise fits complete records within each iovec, never "
"splitting a record across two iovecs. ``FIONREAD`` returns total queued bytes including padding."

msgid ""
"``IN_CREATE``、``IN_DELETE``、``IN_MODIFY``、``IN_ATTRIB``、 "
"``IN_OPEN``、``IN_CLOSE_WRITE``、``IN_CLOSE_NOWRITE``、 "
"``IN_ACCESS``、``IN_MOVE_SELF``、``IN_DELETE_SELF`` 及移动父目录事件 来自实际 VFS 或 syscall 完成路径。重命名的 "
"``IN_MOVED_FROM`` 和 ``IN_MOVED_TO`` 共用非零 cookie。目录事件按 Linux 语义附带 ``IN_ISDIR``。 内部页缓存读取和 ``mmap`` "
"缺页不产生用户读取事件。"
msgstr ""
"``IN_CREATE``, ``IN_DELETE``, ``IN_MODIFY``, ``IN_ATTRIB``, ``IN_OPEN``, ``IN_CLOSE_WRITE``, "
"``IN_CLOSE_NOWRITE``, ``IN_ACCESS``, ``IN_MOVE_SELF``, ``IN_DELETE_SELF``, and parent-directory "
"move events originate from actual VFS or syscall completion paths. A rename's ``IN_MOVED_FROM`` "
"and ``IN_MOVED_TO`` share a nonzero cookie. Directory events carry ``IN_ISDIR`` according to Linux"
" semantics. Internal page-cache reads and ``mmap`` faults do not generate user read events."

msgid ""
"监听以 inode 身份关联：重命名不把监听转移给同名新文件，硬链接指向同一个 监听对象。``IN_MASK_ADD`` 合并掩码，``IN_MASK_CREATE`` 拒绝覆盖已有监听， "
"``IN_ONLYDIR``、``IN_DONT_FOLLOW``、``IN_EXCL_UNLINK`` 和 ``IN_ONESHOT`` 按各自语义处理。删除、显式移除和文件系统终止会生成 "
"``IN_IGNORED``；卸载还生成 ``IN_UNMOUNT``。监听本身不保留路径引用， 不会仅因存在监听而阻止卸载。"
msgstr ""
"Watches attach to inode identity: renaming does not transfer a watch to a new file with the same "
"name, and hard links refer to the same watched object. ``IN_MASK_ADD`` merges masks, "
"``IN_MASK_CREATE`` refuses to overwrite an existing watch, and ``IN_ONLYDIR``, ``IN_DONT_FOLLOW``,"
" ``IN_EXCL_UNLINK``, and ``IN_ONESHOT`` follow their respective semantics. Deletion, explicit "
"removal, and filesystem termination generate ``IN_IGNORED``; unmounting also generates "
"``IN_UNMOUNT``. Watches retain no path references and do not prevent unmounting merely by "
"existing."

msgid ""
"``dup``、``fork`` 和传递的描述符共享同一个打开文件描述及队列；最后一个 引用释放时撤销全部监听。``CLOEXEC`` 属于描述符，``O_NONBLOCK`` 属于 "
"共享打开文件描述。对该 fd 写入返回 ``EBADF``，定位读取返回 ``ESPIPE``。 ``lseek`` 遵守 Linux 匿名 inode 的空操作行为，对支持的 whence "
"返回零。"
msgstr ""
"``dup``, ``fork``, and passed descriptors share one open file description and queue; releasing the"
" last reference removes all watches. ``CLOEXEC`` belongs to the descriptor, while ``O_NONBLOCK`` "
"belongs to the shared open file description. Writing to the fd returns ``EBADF`` and positioned "
"reads return ``ESPIPE``. ``lseek`` follows Linux anonymous-inode no-op behavior and returns zero "
"for supported whence values."

msgid "容量与恢复"
msgstr "Capacity and Recovery"

msgid "root 可以通过下列 ``0644`` 控制文件读取或修改非负整数策略，普通用户只读："
msgstr ""
"root can read or change nonnegative integer policies through these ``0644`` control files; other "
"users have read-only access:"

msgid "``/proc/sys/fs/inotify/`` 下的节点"
msgstr "Nodes under ``/proc/sys/fs/inotify/``"

msgid "默认值及含义"
msgstr "Defaults and Meaning"

msgid "``max_user_instances``"
msgstr "``max_user_instances``"

msgid "128；每个真实 UID 的实例数，超限返回 ``EMFILE``。"
msgstr "128; instances per real UID. Exceeding the limit returns ``EMFILE``."

msgid "``max_user_watches``"
msgstr "``max_user_watches``"

msgid "8192；每个真实 UID 的监听数，超限返回 ``ENOSPC``。"
msgstr "8192; watches per real UID. Exceeding the limit returns ``ENOSPC``."

msgid "``max_queued_events``"
msgstr "``max_queued_events``"

msgid "16384；新实例的事件队列容量，已有实例保留创建时的容量。"
msgstr ""
"16384; event queue capacity for new instances. Existing instances retain their creation-time "
"capacity."

msgid ""
"零值可阻止后续资源创建；降低策略不会撤销已有实例或监听。实际内存分配仍可能 失败。通知分配失败或队列已满时，原文件操作保持其结果，队列提供 ``wd == -1`` 的 "
"``IN_Q_OVERFLOW``。应用收到溢出后必须重新扫描，不能继续 把旧缓存当作完整状态。相邻相同的未读事件可合并，通知数量不是操作计数器。"
msgstr ""
"Zero can prevent subsequent resource creation; lowering policies does not revoke existing "
"instances or watches. Actual memory allocation can still fail. If notification allocation fails or"
" the queue is full, the original file operation retains its result and the queue provides "
"``IN_Q_OVERFLOW`` with ``wd == -1``. Applications must rescan after overflow rather than treating "
"old caches as complete state. Adjacent identical unread events may coalesce; notification counts "
"are not operation counters."

msgid "使用边界"
msgstr "Usage Boundaries"

msgid ""
"目录监听只覆盖直接子项；递归监听需要应用逐目录安装监听并处理竞态。 通知不能作为审计日志或保证每次写入单独报告，也不能保证读取通知时旧文件名 仍指向同一对象。读事件到无效用户地址时按 Linux "
"语义返回 ``EFAULT``， 该次已出队的记录不会恢复；应用应使用有效、足够大的用户缓冲区。"
msgstr ""
"Directory watches cover only direct children; recursive monitoring requires applications to "
"install per-directory watches and handle races. Notifications are not audit logs, do not guarantee"
" a separate report for each write, and do not guarantee that an old filename still refers to the "
"same object when read. Reading events to an invalid user address returns ``EFAULT`` with Linux "
"semantics; records already dequeued by that call are not restored. Applications should use valid, "
"sufficiently large user buffers."

msgid "当前不提供 fanotify、网络文件系统远端事件或可选调试 ioctl ``INOTIFY_IOC_SETNEXTWD`` 的实现；不支持的 ioctl 返回错误，不伪造成功。"
msgstr ""
"fanotify, remote events on network filesystems, and the optional debug ioctl "
"``INOTIFY_IOC_SETNEXTWD`` are not currently implemented. Unsupported ioctls return errors rather "
"than fabricated success."

msgid "验证入口"
msgstr "Validation Entry Points"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_inotify_core.py``、``tools/test_inotify_vfs.py``、 ``tools/test_inotify_adapter.py`` 和 "
"``tools/test_inotify_proc.py`` 分别检查 实际队列/监听、VFS 生命周期、用户复制/等待及 sysctl 配额。 "
"``tools/test_inotify_abi.py`` 在 Linux 上运行同一份 ABI 对照探针； ``tools/tests/inotify_runtime_probe.c`` "
"也可静态编译后在来宾执行。 系统镜像及 Fileman 验证脚本由 ReliefOS 仓库持有。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_inotify_core.py``, ``tools/test_inotify_vfs.py``, ``tools/test_inotify_adapter.py``, "
"and ``tools/test_inotify_proc.py`` check actual queues/watches, VFS lifecycles, user "
"copying/waiting, and sysctl quotas respectively. ``tools/test_inotify_abi.py`` runs the same ABI "
"comparison probe on Linux; ``tools/tests/inotify_runtime_probe.c`` can also be statically compiled"
" and run in a guest. The ReliefOS repository owns system image and Fileman validation scripts."

msgid "接口依据见 `Linux inotify 手册 <https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/inotify.7.html>`_。"
msgstr ""
"The interface is based on the `Linux inotify manual <https://man7.org/linux/man-"
"pages/man7/inotify.7.html>`_."
